<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Yang et al. (2022) & Donnay & Pawson (1969) biogenic single-crystal calcite TPMS echinoderm stereom (Diamond D, Gyroid G, Primitive P) & Gibson-Ashby cellular mechanics (Protoreaster nodosus (Asteroidea) & Metacrinus rotundus / Nesometra integra (Crinoidea) / Cidaris rugosa (Echinoidea))",
        "Yang et al. (2022) & Donnay & Pawson (1969) biogenic single-crystal calcite TPMS echinoderm stereom (Diamond D, Gyroid G, Primitive P) & Gibson-Ashby cellular mechanics faithfully reproduces Protoreaster nodosus (Asteroidea) & Metacrinus rotundus / Nesometra integra (Crinoidea) / Cidaris rugosa (Echinoidea) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-4> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Protoreaster nodosus (Asteroidea) & Metacrinus rotundus / Nesometra integra (Crinoidea) / Cidaris rugosa (Echinoidea) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 48.5/100, audit 2026-10-19-crinoid-stereom-gyroid-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py> ;
    schema:about "Protoreaster nodosus (Asteroidea) & Metacrinus rotundus / Nesometra integra (Crinoidea) / Cidaris rugosa (Echinoidea)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2020-gorzelak-crinoid-stereom-gyroid.py; output: docs/media/crinoid_stereom_gyroid_comparison.png; organism: Protoreaster nodosus (Asteroidea) & Metacrinus rotundus / Nesometra integra (Crinoidea) / Cidaris rugosa (Echinoidea); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 7546780a29581d038c82edc49698f8e73b11c59c0a49d82e3dfc8f721733c9d2; artifact_sha256: 15af9af33e400cd89194f5f2adc889844144643f661ebe5efb7e2dc8266184db; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/crinoid_stereom_gyroid/crinoid_stereom_gyroid_reference.json=c1c3848ef15d0bfc..., datasets/crinoid_stereom_gyroid/crinoid_stereom_ossicle_specimen.jpg=5fbf6e4db0ee1d44..., datasets/crinoid_stereom_gyroid/scout_manifest.json=0524b76e141ef1fe...}" ;
