    pk:hypothesisType "Triply Periodic Minimal Surface (TPMS) Nodal Level-Set Geometry (Schwarz Diamond D, Schoen Gyroid G, Schwarz Primitive P), Minimal Surface Zero Mean Curvature (H = 0, K = -kappa_1^2 <= 0) & Gibson-Ashby Cellular Solid Scaling" ;
    pk:weightOfEvidence 4.85e-01 .

