    rdfs:label "Yang et al. (2022) & Donnay & Pawson (1969) biogenic single-crystal calcite TPMS echinoderm stereom (Diamond D, Gyroid G, Primitive P) & Gibson-Ashby cellular mechanics — Code-to-model traceability: 62/100" ;
